    },
    {
      "id": "b21de8ef-1528-45ff-bd4e-d0cd206954e6",
      "type": "image",
      "props": {
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "name": "",
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dartmouth-cs98/content-dartmouth-cs98-26w/main/pages/feature-spec-and-roadmap/assets/1770132911982-7.png",
        "caption": "",
        "showPreview": true,
        "previewWidth": 290
      },
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "862895ef-9998-4696-9630-14e884a550bf",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Name it Roadmap and in the filter box enter in feature:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cdfc3903-005d-4066-9e9f-0d8821cbe3de",
      "type": "image",
      "props": {
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "name": "",
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dartmouth-cs98/content-dartmouth-cs98-26w/main/pages/feature-spec-and-roadmap/assets/1770132928793-8.png",
        "caption": "",
        "showPreview": true,
        "previewWidth": 562
      },
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "3a20b1c8-f8ed-48e9-adcb-6e4c1b9b3724",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We need a way to group together tasks/issues by subject rather than by due date. The main idea is that Issues are small tasks, individually bite-sized coding time, but we need something to group them together into larger features that may take a lot more time. Milestones are a bit of an overkill. So what we’ll do is simply have certain issues describe the feature and potentially include a list of subtasks (subtasks are currently in private beta). ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "55fda192-23e5-4108-84ac-0b5750012024",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "86ad60ed-2fef-49e6-98e6-1fca1e5e43a0",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now Add some Features!",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "91c990be-0255-4efe-8ecb-db66f26ba220",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Click the ➕ to add",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d2b19357-ec13-4db9-a023-c5d151af5d7c",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Title is your feature name. Things like: “robot can drive from point a -> point b”, “display list of posts stored in db”. Again these are big ticket features - not individual tasks.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "443cf7ad-3400-4012-9c68-a2e4912cce5f",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Description - put in as much of a description as you want to make it clear what this is. Ideally you would follow a ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.zenhub.com/blog/how-to-use-epics-and-milestones/",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User Story driven template",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " such as: ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "As <user persona x>, I want to <do task y> so I can <accomplish goal z>",
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "9502da2c-ca22-467b-9063-ec8250c8eef6",
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "choose whether it is: ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "c2b29153-a30e-4b5a-ad09-c1a45ef71020",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "27aaf8d0-c60b-4c70-ad46-1b6821f87baf",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left",
            "level": 3,
            "isToggleable": false
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ 🔥 primary feature]",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "bdaf5ed0-6b69-45e4-9521-ed84db60c6a3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " These are the primary and most important features. The product doesn’t have a purpose without these features. These are sometimes the harder things, but the most necessary to start tackling early to get validation. Try to list these in order that they happen in the user experience.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c3df5b69-dd8e-48be-a1b4-70fbe7cc8435",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "24178dfe-16be-4a4b-b457-ebfccbd8ac80",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left",
            "level": 3,
            "isToggleable": false
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ 💼 secondary feature]",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "9f0048b3-5e0a-4217-ab0e-f7e7ea66fd63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " These are features that make the product more usable, but can be hacked around if necessary. Things like login/auth might go here (unless you are building a security product).",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "a0c6702c-3438-44b3-b4a6-07b02c879fcb",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "2382cd30-6bba-45cf-b517-19ef806ee556",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left",
